{"id":"n87095-1-7","stage":3,"title":"활발히 · 活泼地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87095-1-7-1","ko":"아이가 참 활발히 노네요.","zh":"这孩子真活泼啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"활발히","meaning":"活泼地，活跃地，生龙活虎地","explanation":"활발히：活泼地，活跃地，生龙活虎地","readings":[{"term":"활발히","audio":"/audio/455478e7a2c47103ee00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87095","senseId":"1","lemma":"활발히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노네요.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"(谦词)自己的子女。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"455478e7a2c47103","term":"활발히","zh":"活泼地，活跃地，生龙活虎地","audio":"/audio/455478e7a2c47103ee00.mp3","entryId":"87095","definition":"有生机，充满力量地。","pronunciation":["활발히"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/792fe4dc574e46e26af3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87095-1-7-2","ko":"네, 건강하게 자라서 정말 다행이에요.","zh":"是啊，他能健康地长大真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건강하게","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강하다：健康；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"건강하다","audio":"/audio/941cc7ece011b725bcb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17317","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자라서","meaning":"生长，成长","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다행이에요.","meaning":"万幸，幸事，走运","explanation":"다행：万幸，幸事，走运；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다행","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28359","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"941cc7ece011b725","term":"건강하다","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/941cc7ece011b725bcb5.mp3","entryId":"17317","definition":"身体或精神没有异常，很结实或很强大。","pronunciation":["건ː강하다"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长，成长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"在某种环境过背景下长大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"c1308a8fe6495062","term":"다행","zh":"万幸，幸事，走运","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3","entryId":"28359","definition":"意外地运气好。","pronunciation":["다행"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f8398152456d4ef8c13.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.009,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87095","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":108,"sequenceScore":2.8357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这孩子真活泼啊。","是啊，他能健康地长大真是太好了。","这次游戏要怎么进行呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这孩子真活泼啊。","是啊，他能健康地长大真是太好了。","这次游戏要怎么进行呢？"],"answer":1}]}
